WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.880
Is this really okay?

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.670
It's fine, it's fine!

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.010
This is a bit higher than in the pool!

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:14.930
Yui...

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.590
Let's go, Rena.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.930
Okay.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.510
Sara, Tia!

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:20.350
Okay!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.020
Roger!

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:33.360
Ha ha! She's a load of fun!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.820
Sara, Tia, what do we do next?

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:23.870
--Wow, this is crazy! We just keep falling!
--Spinning and spinning!

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.170
What are we going to do?!

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.170
We can't fly...

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.590
What?

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:35.010
Whaaat?!

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.870
Are you okay, Sara?

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:31.960
Yui!

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:34.920
Let's put our backs together.
We can balance that way.

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.460
You're right!

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:42.220
Here comes a big one!

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:48.680
You're pretty tough!
But I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.520
Eat this!

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:01.820
Yui, right yourself!

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.630
We're about to land.

00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.320
Woah, wuh, aaah!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.660
Yui, are you okay?

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.830
Yeah. What about Sara and Tia?

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:58.540
I thought we were gonna die.

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:03.250
I'm so glad they're safe. Hey, over here! Hey!

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.230
So this is Rimgarde...

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:24.780
Where are we going?

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.660
We've got to hide from whoever that was.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:31.030
I see! Yui, you're so smart!

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.120
Oh, over there!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:38.500
That's Ingrid, isn't it?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:42.840
We went there when we found you,
Rena, don't you remember?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:48.340
Let's go.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.760
Rena...

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.940
Aah, it's cold! I'm tired and hungry, too!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.230
Are you okay, Sara?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.810
I'm hungry, too!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.320
Ta-da!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:17.160
Oh, nice! I knew we could count on you, Tia!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.540
Is that food from the plane?

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:20.920
When did you...?

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.880
Mmm-hmm!

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.710
Way to go!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.010
All right!

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:31.050
Shall we?

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.430
Yeah!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.220
So, Yui is safe, then?

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:38.690
The escort planes confirmed
it via infrared scanner.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:43.390
I think Yui put herself in
danger in order to protect us.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:49.530
Understood. You must
rendezvous with her, quickly.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.240
Come on! Why aren't there
any parachutes on this thing?!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:58.330
Huh? Were you going to parachute down?

00:06:58.540 --> 00:07:02.210
Yeah, I'm worried!
Nothing down there works at all!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.710
Yui lives in a castle; you think
she can handle that?

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.130
Over here, Rena!

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:10.010
Hurry up, Yui!

00:07:10.220 --> 00:07:13.760
Hmm... Yep, yep!

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:16.010
Yep, yep, yep!

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:16.930
Whoa!

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.770
Yui! Yui!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:21.230
Tia?

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:22.980
Check these out!

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:25.270
Oh, is that a tent, too?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.940
When we were climbing up
a cliff all day and got tired,

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.650
we'd sleep in these.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:33.030
You slept on a cliff?
Wow! I wanna try, too!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:38.950
Huh? Hmm? Tia, how did
you get up there?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.580
Calm down...

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.760
Yui, where are we going to sleep?

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:53.720
I don't mind it, but are you okay
with sleeping on such a dusty bed?

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:58.140
Yeah, no problem! It's my first
time sleeping on one of these.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:05.100
Let's sleep in that, Rena!
I've never slept in a tent before!

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:08.400
Tent, tent! Everyone in the tent!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:09.820
Okay?

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.650
Okay.

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:20.370
Wow! Coals get really hot
when you burn them, huh?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.120
If you go like this...

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.540
This side is high heat and
this side is low heat!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.250
Oh, so you can adjust the heat?

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:34.090
All you need is this and you
can make anything! Wanna try?

00:08:34.300 --> 00:08:38.800
Okay, this is high heat, and...

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.140
All right, let's start grilling!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.350
Right! Beginning with vegetables!

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.440
--Let's eat! --Let's eat!

00:08:56.910 --> 00:08:58.320
--Seconds!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.040
--That was delicious!
--That was delicious!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.210
Camping sure is fun!

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:09.130
Yeah! And eating outside
makes the food taste better!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.960
I love it too!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.670
It's not actually that easy.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:17.970
Oh, yeah... You're right.

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:22.270
But I'm surprised. I didn't think
you'd be into this kind of thing, Yui.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:26.970
Oh, really? This is my first time,
so it's super exciting!

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:30.480
Oh...

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:35.280
Hey, Rena, when we get home,
let's do some real camping!

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:35.740
Huh?

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:39.570
We can invite Retty, and Sara
and Tia can show us how it's done!

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:41.080
Leave it to us!

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.040
I can start a fire with just some wood!

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.000
Wow! How do you do that?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:49.670
Well, you take two pieces of wood like this...

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.090
Oh, and the wood has to be dry.
It won't work if it's wet!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.760
Wow...

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:24.120
Do you remember?

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:28.500
We're all going to that place tomorrow.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:31.580
I hope my memory returns.

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:55.770
Yui, come take a bath with me!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.720
This is...

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:44.490
Kei?!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.700
You're right! It's Kei! Kei!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.790
What are you doing, Rena?

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:56.710
Kei...

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.720
Let's go.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.140
Yeah.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.980
Kei! Why won't you talk?

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:17.690
We've been looking for
you for a long, long time!

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.010
Wow!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.010
It's huge!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.840
Amazing!

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:02.690
Welcome to the Kingdom
of Rimgarde, Yuinshiel.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.650
Ingrid...

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.280
That's Ingrid?

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.370
Is she bound to Kei?

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:15.370
Ingrid, what happened here?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.920
Up until 12 years ago, Rimgarde was
among the most technologically

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.510
advanced countries in the world.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:26.010
We had long been researching
a new type of energy,

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:30.720
but its progress came to a halt,
yielding no results.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:37.220
Then, as though they had timed it,
a sort of advisor appeared.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:41.480
Thanks to them, the halted
research was started up again,

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.820
with dazzling results.

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:49.120
But it was a huge mistake.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.830
The Fall of Rimgarde.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:57.960
What do you mean?

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:02.670
That person was just using Rimgarde
to revive a relic from the past.

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.170
A relic from the past?

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:11.220
Lux Ex Machina.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.140
Huh?

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.260
But that's--

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:17.690
Yes. The thing you sealed away.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:20.150
The thing that once wiped out the world.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:23.900
Were you also after Lux Ex Machina?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.490
No. But considering how I am
standing here before you

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.450
after my country has been wiped out,

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.580
I can't blame you for thinking so.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.580
If that's so...

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:40.290
Why are you doing all this? Why are
you involving Enastoria and Rena?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.840
And Kei, too! It's got nothing to do with her!

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:46.880
That's right! Give Kei back!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.300
Kei...?

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:50.720
You see...

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:59.730
Hey! That was a flashy skydiving
stunt you pulled yesterday!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:00.690
That voice!

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.360
Ah! It's the big guy from yesterday!

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:05.770
The guy flying all over the place! Not fair!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:11.490
Hmm? Is that you, Ingrid?
I didn't know you were here!

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:18.910
How convenient! A showdown,
right here, where it all began!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:22.290
Come on, Ingrid, join in!

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.500
Hmm?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.260
Let me help.

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.510
Johann...

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:44.730
Born in light, binding darkness,
arbiter of truth,

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:48.900
dwelling within me,
reveal the false purgatory.

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:55.370
Covetous flames, sacred relics
of undying hellfire!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.160
Everyone, get back!

00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.420
In the name of Erinius...

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:05.710
Ingrid!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.840
...reveal yourself!

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:08.960
Ingrid!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.590
Yui! Get back!

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:19.390
Xeno Megaera.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.790
Ingrid...

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.210
Yuinshiel...

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.100
Good girl.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.390
Yui!

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.810
We've got to go, too.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:02.430
But...

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.850
Yui!

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:08.770
All right. Let's go, Rena!

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:12.030
Here we go, Tia!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.440
Okay!

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.200
At last, the gang's all here!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:29.170
Well then, let the showdown begin!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.030
Yui!

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.440
Rena!

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:14.840
Don't run away like that!

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:17.130
Come down here!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:18.970
We've gotta go after 'em!

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.940
Aw, too bad!

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:08.730
A Sun?

00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:10.140
No way!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:16.980
Why, you!

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:31.580
Yui! Yui! Are you okay?

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.840
Thank you, Rena.

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.260
Ouch!

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:45.050
They're pretty tough!

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:48.140
Sara, Tia, are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:50.850
We're fine!

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:54.480
Still alive? Oh, there you are.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:59.190
You're not giving up yet, are you?
The fun is just about to start.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:00.820
That guy's a real pest.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:01.990
A Pest!

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:05.450
Yui, let's take out that big one first!

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:06.870
Okay.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.130
Come on!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.640
Not bad.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:31.520
Yui!

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:32.940
Got it!

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:48.870
A combo, eh?

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.250
What?!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.540
Have we been caught?

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:03.090
Yuinshiel. Hold still,
stay calm, and listen carefully.

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.560
Can you hear me?

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:17.150
The three Regalia of Erinius are together.
We can cause a resonance.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:18.560
Resonance?

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.110
With us, with Kei...

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:28.740
Wonderful! Hang on to them,
just like that, Ingrid!

00:21:47.090 --> 00:21:50.890
Come on! Keep a hold of them!

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:03.900
Ingrid...
